/* antd v6 renders FloatButton as an antd Button (`button.ant-btn.ant-float-btn`), so much of its box
   model comes from `.ant-btn*` rules. ng-zorro's host does not carry the `ant-btn` layer (v4 button
   styles would apply to it too), so these rules mirror onto ng-zorro's structure what v6's
   `.ant-float-btn*` CSS alone does not supply. Per-type colours come from the `nz-button` directive
   on `.ant-float-btn-inner`, which already emits the v6 `ant-btn` colour and variant classes. */

