   fills the button (as v4's `.ant-float-btn .ant-badge` does) and the insets go on the wrapper's indicator,
   which v6 Badge already pins to the top-end corner with `translate(50%, -50%)`. antd measures from inside
   the button's `--ant-line-width` border; the inner button here has none outside the progress ring, so the
   line width is added. An `nzOffset` margin-top, set inline, replaces the inset on that axis. */
nz-float-button-content > .ant-badge {
