   toggling `ant-form-validate_animation-enter/leave`), unlike antd v6, which drives it through
   `rc-component/form`'s `ErrorList.js` (`CSSMotionList`, confirmed against a live antd `validate-static`
   dump: with a single visible message the container itself carries `ant-form-item-explain
   ant-form-show-help ant-form-show-help-appear[-active]` — no separate `-show-help-item` element).
