   > .ant-form-item-control`), breaking the default (v4) inline layout. These two rules mirror v6's
   `.ant-form-item-horizontal >.ant-form-item-row>.ant-col-24.ant-form-item-label` /
   `.ant-form-item-vertical >.ant-form-item-row>.ant-col-24.ant-form-item-label` (and their `-xl-24`
