/*
 * v6 draws the preview toolbar as a bottom-centered pill (`.ant-image-preview-footer`,
 * `position: absolute; bottom: var(--ant-margin-xl); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%)`).
 * ng-zorro keeps the v4 top bar element (`.ant-image-preview-operations-wrapper`, itself
 * `position: fixed; top: 0; right: 0; width: 100%; z-index: …`) and adds the v6 class to it
 * rather than a second element. v6's own rule does not set `top`/`right`/`width`/`z-index`,
 * so those v4 values linger on the same element and, combined with `left: 50%` plus a
